{"baseRefName":"docs/analytics-sparklines-release-markers","baseRefOid":"444a049db0a2959b3f42eaf40f6b92f6905a8f0b","body":"## What changed\n\nKanna walks (stack 3/5; base: PR 2 branch). A raster still can bob but cannot swing a leg, so while she travels she is now drawn as vector parts on the same palette and proportions as the `go` still: a hip and a knee per leg, a tail that sways from its root, ears that trail the head.\n\n- `lib/fox-gait.ts` (pure): stride phase → joint angles; diagonal legs pair, stance is linear so a planted foot holds still, the knee folds on a half-sine. **Phase advances by distance travelled, never a timer**, so her feet match her speed and stop on the frame she does.\n- **She leans into her path** (`withHeading`): nose-up on a climb, nose-down on a descent (capped at 52°), head leads, front paws reach and hind legs drive on a steep climb. Smoothed with a fixed time constant (same feel at 30/60/144 Hz). Facing stays horizontal.\n- Roaming fox swaps to the walker while travelling, eases into a standing pose as she stops, then crossfades (140 ms) to the resting still.\n- `lib/patrol-machine.ts` (pure, injected random) + `kunai-fox-patrol.tsx`: she paces the footer's top edge only while it is on screen and the tab is visible; still under reduced motion.\n- Facing left is an instant CSS flip (easing swept her through zero width). Nav/sidebar mark hovers are a quick ease-out, gated to hover-capable devices.\n\n## Verification evidence\n\nTested commit: this branch head. `rm -rf .next && bun run typecheck && bun run lint && bun run fmt:check && bun run test` in `apps/docs` → clean / 0 errors / clean / **343 pass, 0 fail**.\n\n- Unit: gait periodicity, stance linearity, diagonal pairing, bounds; heading sign/cap/head-lead/frame-rate independence; patrol speed, arrival, pause range, resize clamp (a test caught a real bug: after a resize the stale target was off the lane and she stepped past the right end); walker rig exposes every part and server output is already a standing pose.\n- Browser, Claude in Chrome (real pointer): pointer sent up-right → nose-up climb; down-right → nose-down dive; level → walk with articulated legs; then settles into the resting still. Reduced-motion emulation: no roamer, footer fox still.\n- Not exercised: pure-vertical and pure-horizontal-left walks in a live browser (covered by unit tests and the 52° cap), a physical touch device.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Changeset: N/A (docs-only)\n- [x] `bun run guard`: N/A\n- [x] fmt / lint / test / typecheck pass locally (per package)\n- [ ] `bun run build` — run once on the top of the stack (PR 5), passes\n- [x] Live provider or Discord smokes skipped intentionally (docs only)\n","files":[{"path":"apps/docs/app/styles/fox.css","additions":111,"deletions":37,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/brand/README.md","additions":33,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/brand/kunai-fox-patrol.tsx","additions":124,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/brand/kunai-fox-roamer.tsx","additions":79,"deletions":15,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/components/brand/kunai-fox-walker.tsx","additions":241,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/fox-gait.ts","additions":257,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/patrol-machine.ts","additions":100,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/fox-gait.test.ts","additions":203,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/kunai-fox-walker.test.tsx","additions":46,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/patrol-machine.test.ts","additions":150,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"}],"headRefName":"docs/kanna-walks","headRefOid":"ba1b62c18b11a345e11d07baaad486261917c6e3","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":534,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:16:20Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"ht